    "detailed_description": "Get ready for explosive excitement in Boom! In this fast-paced action game, you'll face off against a variety of monsters in each stage. As you progress through the levels, you'll have the opportunity to pick up different bombs and power-ups that will help you defeat your enemies and advance to the next stage. With challenging gameplay, colorful graphics, and a variety of levels to play through, Boom will keep you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. Don't wait any longer to join the action - download Boom today and see if you have what it takes to be the ultimate bomber, but be careful not to get blown up first!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced action gameplay<br></li><li> Find key hidden inside the crates to open the door to complete the level<br></li><li> Collect different types of power-ups hidden inside the crates<br></li><li> Customize your character from top to bottom<br></li><li> Progressive difficulty that increases as the player advance through the levels<br></li><li> Unique boss fight in final level of the stage</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> More single player levels (5 different stages with 20 levels each)<br></li><li> Multiplayer mode - play with 2-4 players/friends<br></li><li> Multiplayer mode - different modes (free-for-all, team)<br></li><li> Steam achievements<br></li><li> Steam leaderboard</li></ul>",
